  "appliesTo": "Most Medway schools have the same holiday dates, but some academy, voluntary-aided or foundation schools may differ. If in doubt, contact the individual school.",
  "academyNote": "Academies have the authority to set their own term dates.",
  "localFacts": [
    {
      "fact": "Medway's term dates give a total of 195 days: maintained schools provide 190 teaching days and use the remaining 5 for staff development.",
      "source": "https://www.medway.gov.uk/info/200137/schools_and_learning/355/school_term_dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Each Medway school is free to decide when its 5 staff development days take place.",
      "source": "https://www.medway.gov.uk/info/200137/schools_and_learning/355/school_term_dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Medway numbers its year in six terms and calls its breaks the autumn, Christmas, February, Easter and late spring breaks.",
      "source": "https://www.medway.gov.uk/info/200137/schools_and_learning/355/school_term_dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "In 2027-28 Term 1 starts on Monday 6 September 2027 and Term 6 runs to Wednesday 26 July 2028.",
      "source": "https://www.medway.gov.uk/info/200137/schools_and_learning/355/school_term_dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Medway already lists dates for September 2028 to July 2029, with Term 1 starting on Friday 1 September 2028.",
      "source": "https://www.medway.gov.uk/info/200137/schools_and_learning/355/school_term_dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Dates are set after public consultation; the council publishes the 2026 to 2027 consultation document and a joint 2027 to 2028 and 2028 to 2029 consultation document.",
      "source": "https://www.medway.gov.uk/downloads/download/392/school_consultations"
    }
  ],
